<title>FRANCE: Club Med 1995/96 sales fall.</title>
<headline>Club Med 1995/96 sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to October 31, 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>Turnover					 8,012    vs    8,467</p>
<p>NOTE - Club Mediterranee issued its provisional sales figure in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the drop was due essentially to the sale of the Maeva unit that contributed 385 million francs to 1994/95 sales, and was only partly offset by a 43 million franc contribution in the fourth quarter of 1995/96 from Forum Voyages.</p>
<p>At constant structure and exchange rates, 1995/96 sales were down 0.5 percent, it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
